  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「よぉし、到着なのだあ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「しかし漠然と『畑』といっても広いからなあ、双子を見つけられるかなあ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「まぁ電波女の情報だし、どれだけ信用できるかわからんけど……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「んひゃっ、なぁに下僕くん？　どうして、せえとかいちょおの頭を『ぐいぐい』押すのだあ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「えっ、『背がのびなくなるツボ』だって？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「やめて！　どうしてそんな意地悪するのだあっ、私『ちんちくりん』なのコンプレックスなのに！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「うう。私が時国そらのことを、『電波女』って呼ぶのが気に入らないのか……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「そうだな、わかってる。苦手なやつと、無理に仲良くする必要は全然ないと思うけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「だからって、積極的に喧嘩するべきでもない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「時国そらとも、いつか気軽に渾名で呼びあえるような関係になれたらいいなあ……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「そのときのために、渾名を考えておくべきだろうか。『ときくにそら』だから……くにくに？　そ～らん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「わひょっ!?　今度はどうしたっ、急に抱きしめるな！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/embarrassed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「んもう、せえとかいちょおの大人の色気に我慢できなくなったのね！　いけない子……！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「あぁ、トラックが走ってるな。危ないから、歩道に寄せてくれたのだなあ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「でもビックリするから、急に抱きしめるのやめてね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「うん。あのトラックは今度の『料理大会』のために、野菜とか果物とか……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「このへんの畑とかで収穫された食材を、運んでいるのだあ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「収穫の大部分は、近所の商店街に卸されるけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「余りものとか、型崩れしたやつは『料理大会』に用いられる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「というか。『そういうの』を処理するために、毎年『料理大会』が企画されるのだあ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
